node_modules/
# Generated data stays out of git, with four exceptions. The seed list is the
# input every later stage reads (ticket 51). The sitemap extract and its manifest
# are the production evidence the log's page counts can be checked against, and
# they are 289 KB against 181 MB of source (ticket 52). The status measurement is
# the answer to ticket 22, which exists because 451 phantom status values were
# recorded and nobody could check them (ticket 53).
data/*
!data/10-store-seeds.json
!data/sitemap-extract.json
!data/sitemap-manifest.json
!data/11-page-status.json
dist/
.astro/
.env
.env.local
*.log
